### 4. `POST /api/products` - Create Product

**Access:** Admin only

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "Classic T-Shirt",
  "slug": "classic-t-shirt",
  "description": "Comfortable cotton t-shirt",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": true,
  "variants": [
    {
      "sku": "TS-001-S-BLK",
      "price": 29.99,
      "stock": 50,
      "isActive": true,
      "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
      "discountValue": 10,
      "discountStart": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
      "discountEnd": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z",
      "attributes": [
        { "attributeId": 1, "valueId": 1 },
        { "attributeId": 2, "valueId": 5 }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "images": [
    {
      "url": "data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRg...",
      "altText": "Classic T-Shirt",
      "position": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

**Response (201):**
```json
{
  "message": "Product created successfully",
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Classic T-Shirt",
    "slug": "classic-t-shirt",
    "description": "Comfortable cotton t-shirt",
    "isActive": true,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-17T06:00:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T06:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

