## Key DTO Structures

### `CreateProductDto`
| Field | Type | Required |
|-------|------|----------|
| `name` | string | Yes |
| `description` | string | Yes |
| `slug` | string | Yes |
| `categoryId` | number | Yes |
| `isActive` | boolean | No |
| `variants` | `VariantWithAttributesDto[]` | No |
| `images` | `CreateProductImageDto[]` | No |

### `VariantWithAttributesDto`
| Field | Type | Required |
|-------|------|----------|
| `sku` | string | No |
| `price` | number | Yes |
| `stock` | number | Yes |
| `isActive` | boolean | No |
| `discountType` | `DiscountType` | No |
| `discountValue` | number | No |
| `discountStart` | string | No |
| `discountEnd` | string | No |
| `attributes` | `VariantAttributeDto[]` | Yes |

### `VariantAttributeDto`
| Field | Type | Required |
|-------|------|----------|
| `attributeId` | number | Yes |
| `valueId` | number | Yes |